@startuml Activity_Diagram_UC05
title Activity Diagram: UC-05 Manage Order

|Customer|
start
:Select product(s) from catalog and add to cart;
if (Custom cake design attached?) then (Yes)
  :Attach saved cake design to the cart item;
else (No)
  :Continue with standard product selection;
endif
|System|
:Update cart contents and running total;
:Check availability of all cart items and ingredients;
if (All items available?) then (Yes)
  |Customer|
  :Proceed to Checkout Page;
  :Enter delivery details, contact information, and payment method;
  :Confirm order details and submit order;
  |System|
  :Create order record with status "Pending";
  :Perform payment processing;
  if (Payment successful?) then (Yes)
    :Forward order to centralized Order History Page/POS portal;
    :Notify Staff/Admin of new order;
    |Staff/Admin|
    :Review new order in dashboard;
    if (Accept order?) then (Yes)
      :Update order status to "Confirmed";
      :Notify customer of order confirmation;
      |Kitchen Staff|
      :Update order status during preparation (In Preparation / Ready);
      |Delivery Driver|
      :View assigned orders;
      :Mark order as Picked Up and Delivered;
      |System|
      :Update customer order-tracking status;
      :Send notifications to customer;
    else (No)
      :Update order status to "Rejected";
      :Notify customer of rejection;
    endif
  else (No)
    :Notify customer that payment failed;
    :Allow retry or alternate payment method;
  endif
else (No)
  |System|
  :Flag unavailable item(s);
  :Suggest substitute options or cancellation;
  |Customer|
  :Choose substitute or cancel order;
endif

if (Order received from external platform?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Consolidate third-party order into centralized dashboard;
  |Staff/Admin|
  :Review and accept or reject the order;
else (No)
  :Continue fulfillment process;
endif

if (Customer or Staff/Admin cancels order before preparation begins?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Update order status to "Cancelled";
  :Release reserved stock through Manage Inventory;
else (No)
  :Continue processing order;
endif

stop
@enduml
